<title>SINGAPORE: Singapore bunker final report and prices - June 3.</title>
<headline>Singapore bunker final report and prices - June 3.</headline>
<text>
<p>(DELIVERED U.S.$/TONNE)  380 CST   180 CST     MDO     GAS OIL</p>
<p> SINGAPORE CARGO	    94/95    101/102     UNQ     186/187</p>
<p> SINGAPORE BUNKER	   96/98    103/105   188/192   198/202</p>
<p>--------</p>
<p>COMMENTS - Singapore bunker quotes stabilised around their recent levels on Tuesday, with suppliers complaining that the market failed to follow overnight crude gains. One supplier said he fixed a parcel of the 380-cst grade at $97 per tonne late on Tuesday and predicted similar levels on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- Singapore Newsroom (65-870-3571)</p>
